  "body": "Beautiful sea views, generous land and an exceptional coastal location - this is a place where space, lifestyle and opportunity come together.\r\n\r\nWelcome to 136 Clovelly Road, Bucklands Beach - a wonderful opportunity to secure an elevated coastal home on an impressive 1,034sqm (more or less) of freehold land, right in the heart of the highly desirable Macleans College zone.\r\n\r\nDesigned for comfortable family living, this four-bedroom home offers generous indoor and outdoor spaces, with stunning views across the Hauraki Gulf.\r\n\r\nThe upstairs living and dining areas make the most of the beautiful outlook, while the well-appointed kitchen and inviting living spaces create the perfect setting for everyday family life and entertaining.\r\n\r\nOutside, the spacious grounds offer plenty of room to enjoy the fresh coastal air, create your own garden retreat, or simply relax and appreciate the peaceful surroundings. It's a setting that gives every member of the family space to enjoy.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n\r\n* Elevated position with beautiful Hauraki Gulf views\r\n* Generous 1,034sqm (more or less) freehold section\r\n* Four bedrooms and two bathrooms\r\n* Master bedroom with ensuite, walk-in wardrobe and sea views\r\n* Spacious living and dining areas with indoor-outdoor flow\r\n* Double garage plus additional off-street parking\r\n* Residential - Mixed Housing Suburban zoning\r\n* Exciting possibilities for families, investors and those looking to secure a substantial coastal landholding\r\n\r\nA Location You'll Love\r\n\r\nPositioned in the sought-after Bucklands Beach peninsula, this home offers an exceptional combination of coastal lifestyle and everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nEnjoy easy access to beautiful local beaches, scenic coastal walks, Half Moon Bay Marina, cafes and restaurants.\r\n\r\nFamilies will appreciate the highly regarded school zones, including Bucklands Beach Primary, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Macleans College.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for a beautiful family home, a coastal lifestyle, or a property with long-term possibilities, this is an opportunity worth exploring.\r\n\r\nLarge freehold landholdings in such desirable coastal locations are always worth a closer look.\r\n\r\nDon't miss your chance to discover everything 136 Clovelly Road has to offer.",
